    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443">

                <pb facs="0587" n="545" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg545"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord
                        Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-04-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 3, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your communication of yesterday, recommending the request of the
                    passengers of the captured British steamer Peterhoff, which has arrived at New
                    York, to be allowed to leave the vessel with their personal effects, in order to
                    have free access to the consul, and to state that the matter has been submitted
                    to the consideration of the Secretary of the Navy.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
